[0.0, "o", "# Mariano's collector 1.8.0rc4: a recorded walkthrough.\r\n"]
[0.344, "o", "# Recorded on 2026-11-02 on Hamza's workstation (Windows 11), NOT on the client's VM. Every command below runs\r\n"]
[0.703, "o", "# for real while it is recorded, and its output appears as it arrives; nothing is typed in afterwards. The\r\n"]
[1.047, "o", "# collector writes JSON lines: they are shown one line per event (time, level, event, message), cut at the\r\n"]
[1.407, "o", "# screen's width. The whole outputs are kept beside this recording. The video shortens idle time only.\r\n"]
[1.75, "o", "#\r\n"]
[2.11, "o", "# Live scope: store 53100502 Marianos Vernon Hills, 1720 N Milwaukee Ave, Vernon Hills IL 60061, PICKUP, through\r\n"]
[2.453, "o", "# the Oxylabs Web API on Hamza's own account (not the client's Classic account). CSV rows 22-27 only: a\r\n"]
[2.797, "o", "# qualification scope, NOT the client's full category list. q180.sh sets this stage's database, configuration,\r\n"]
[3.157, "o", "# data folder and key file, then runs the collector's command line (python -m marianos_headless.cli).\r\n"]
[3.5, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.5, "o", "$ git -C C:/m6/qwt log -1 --format='%H %s'\r\n"]
