[9.235, "o", "# Earlier today at this store (same stage, same database):\r\n"]
[9.578, "o", "#   Q1  (1.8.0rc1) stopped itself at the canary: a product's data stated its price for no store. Fixed in rc2.\r\n"]
[9.938, "o", "#   Q1b (1.8.0rc2) stopped itself on three grids drawn as 'mini' product cards. Fixed in rc3.\r\n"]
[10.282, "o", "#   Q1c (1.8.0rc3) was killed hard while a page was in flight, resumed, read rows 23-26 to their end and was\r\n"]
[10.625, "o", "#       published to this stage's own local folder: it is the last-good dataset now.\r\n"]
[10.985, "o", "#   1.8.0rc4 fixes two defects found in Q1c's export (coverage files not read back; collector version 1.7.0).\r\n"]
